  <AltText>
    A sprite of our friend, Cabbage's fursona, Math. He is a vulpid with brown and dark grey fur, with a white underbelly. He also has dark green eyes. Next to him are two pawprints, one that is the gay flag, and the other is the aromantic flag. Our watermark, a simple red pawprint, in also next to him.
  </AltText>
  <Description>
    The wheel of fate chose Math here, and here's a sprite of him :3
